' ── AUTHORITATIVE SOURCES ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
'   presence vs verification : https://developers.yubico.com/WebAuthn/WebAuthn_Developer_Guide/User_Presence_vs_User_Verification.html
'   ssh commit signing       : https://docs.gitlab.com/user/project/repository/signed_commits/ssh/
